  "pdf_sha256": "020c8ce42595fcca7c41ebf3960599287aa83cffeb6dfb846cc0156a2b8793ef",
  "rights": "原刊本文及逐欄自讀錄字。數位原圖留於館藏與 Commons 外鏈。",
  "range": "第14面，卷十一第十一葉下至十二葉上，全18欄。",
  "columns": [
    {
      "locator": "14R01",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18,
      "text": "前廢帝何皇后諱令婉廬江灊人也孝建三年"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R02",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 18,
      "end": 36,
      "text": "納為皇太子妃大明五年薨于東宮徽光殿諡"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R03",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 36,
      "end": 54,
      "text": "曰獻妃廢帝即位追崇曰獻皇后明帝踐祚遷"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R04",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "后與廢帝合葬龍山北后父瑀字幼玉晉尚書"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R05",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 91,
      "text": "左僕射澄曾孫也瑀尚武帝少女豫章康長公主"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R06",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 91,
      "end": 109,
      "text": "諱次男公主先適徐喬美容色聰敏有智數文"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R07",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 109,
      "end": 127,
      "text": "帝世禮待特隆瑀豪競於時與平昌孟靈休東"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R08",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 127,
      "end": 145,
      "text": "海何勗等並以輿馬相尚公主與瑀情愛隆密"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14R09",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "右",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 163,
      "text": "何氏疎戚莫不霑被恩禮瑀位右衞將軍主薨"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L01",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 1,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 163,
      "end": 181,
      "text": "瑀墓開孝武追贈瑀金紫光祿大夫子邁尚文"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L02",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 2,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 181,
      "end": 199,
      "text": "帝第十女新蔡公主諱英媚邁少以貴戚居顯"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L03",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 3,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 199,
      "end": 217,
      "text": "官好犬馬馳逐多聚才力士位南濟陰太守廢"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L04",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 4,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 217,
      "end": 235,
      "text": "帝納公主於後宮偽言薨殞殺一婢送出邁第"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L05",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 5,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 235,
      "end": 253,
      "text": "殯葬行喪禮常疑邁有異圖邁亦招聚同志欲"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L06",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 253,
      "end": 271,
      "text": "因行廢立事覺見誅明帝即位追封建寧縣侯"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L07",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 271,
      "end": 289,
      "text": "瑀兄子衍性躁動位黃門郎拜竟求司徒司馬"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L08",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 8,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 289,
      "end": 307,
      "text": "得司馬復求太子右率拜一二日復求侍中旬"
    },
    {
      "locator": "14L09",
      "pdf_page": 14,
      "half": "左",
      "from_right": 9,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/NAJDA-280-0079_%E5%8D%97%E5%8F%B27.pdf#page=14",
      "start": 307,
      "end": 323,
      "text": "日之間求進無已不得侍中以怨罵賜死"
    }
  ],
